dde-dock-input-source (0.1.5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Cache monitor information instead of scanning on each panel opening.
  * Listen for DRM hotplug events as well as Qt desktop screen changes.
  * Coalesce connection events and preserve manual and post-switch refreshes.

